# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — 纯 Python unittest 上游测试的运行时环境恢复（PYTHONPATH 注入） ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-21
# Software: pyjson5 0.15.0（任何以子进程方式执行被测 python 包的 unittest 套件）
# Gate: 上游测试运行（python3 -m unittest discover）
# Status: DRAFT — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

# To promote:
#   1. Review the evidence below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv
#   4. Write knowledge/doc/E0XX.md

id:                     E2469
title:                  纯 Python unittest out-of-proc 子进程包导入失败 → 注入精确 PYTHONPATH 重跑（运行时环境恢复，非修改上游测试）
trigger_tool:           python|unittest|subprocess|import
phase:                  runtime|testing
error_signature:        ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'json5'|python -m <pkg>: exit 1|Can't open file|no module named
severity:               2
category:               python, runtime, testing
match_keywords:         unittest, discover, subprocess, out-of-proc, sys.executable, -m, ModuleNotFoundError,
                        PYTHONPATH, sys.path, temp cwd, uv, 预安装环境, tool_test, python -m json5
root_cause:             子进程 cwd 为临时目录且未被安装到解释器环境；上游 CI 的
                        `python run tests` 依赖 uv 预装（venv 已含该包）——设备/构建
                        环境无此假设时，包导入路径缺失
affected_scope:         所有以 out-of-proc 子进程执行被测 python 包的上游 unittest 套件
                        （tool_test 型）；同样适用于 console entry point 的端到端测试
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           pythonpath-inject-rerun
rec_description:        记录子进程实际探测的包/路径 → 注入精确 PYTHONPATH（源码根或
                        site-packages）→ 以同一入口重跑 → 如实上报通过率与恢复过程
rec_command:            cd <src> && PYTHONPATH=<src> TMPDIR=<writable> python3 -m unittest discover -p '*_test.py' -v
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               环境变量注入（子进程继承），无需源码修改；TMPDIR 同时解决 /tmp erofs（E002）
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      将包真正安装进环境（pip install / setup.py develop）后重跑
fallback_description:   语义等价但更重；对"验证源码"场景过度，对"验证已安装制品"场景才必需
fallback_command:       python3 -m pip install --no-deps --no-build-isolation . && python3 -m unittest discover -p '*_test.py' -v
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          需要 pip/构建依赖可用
principles:               
doc_file:               knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-pyjson5-0.15.0-unittest-pythonpath-recovery.kv
last_updated:           2026-09-21
source_event:           pyjson5 0.15.0 R02：tool_test 15 例失败 → PYTHONPATH=源码根 重跑 75/75 OK
authors:                AtomCode
source_pr:              feat/pyjson5-0.15.0
verification_cmd:       # 以 source_pr CI 门禁为准（PR feat/pyjson5-0.15.0）
